WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:04.920
Okay, I'm going to talk to you about truths and concealment.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:12.630
History presents itself as an attempt to tell us something about the past.

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:16.890
But in fact, it hardly do so.

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.500
In most cases, it is there to conceal our shame.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:26.520
This is very important to understand.

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:29.970
For instance, Jewish history hardly tells us what...

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.360
what really happened in the past, or try to explain us why Jews suffer.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:46.170
What it does, it tries to conceal the fact that wherever Jews go, a disaster is about to happen.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:50.180
Look at Jewish history, it's an endless chain of holocausts.

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:51.940
But Jews are not alone.

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:59.920
Palestinians, after 100 years of Palestinian...

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:10.210
struggle national struggle they achieved nothing palestinian history is an attempt to conceal

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:20.590
this very embarrassing fact what about the brits british you know about them they used to be here

00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:29.980
as well. And they tried to conceal it. Brits got a lot of gel.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:36.760
to their names, but you won't find any of those genocides in any British Museum.

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:46.160
In the British Imperial Wars Museum, they dedicated a full floor to genocide,

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:50.480
but it's the Nazi Holocaust. And what about you?

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:56.150
You have a Holocaust Museum, pretty much in every capital,

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:59.750
which is an attempt to conceal.

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:03.250
the pain that you inflicted on other people.

00:02:05.050 --> 00:02:05.990
It is very simple.

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:07.510
But how does it happen?

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:09.770
How does it take place?

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:13.640
Who manages the concealment?

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:14.800
Who takes care of it?

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:17.900
This is a big question.

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:23.250
In order to understand this question,

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:28.910
I'll talk about Palestine.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:34.730
And the Palestinian solidarity discourse, I believe that a lot of people here support Palestine.

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:41.320
And I'm going to annoy you, I'm very good at it, I make a living out of it.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:53.450
But it is very embarrassing, and I believe that the way to improve the situation,

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:59.970
our situation, the situation in Palestine around the world, is to start to understand our...

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:13.840
works. We will look now into each of the Palestinian solidarity main terms that

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:20.390
we employ when we look into this conflict. Zionism. Just before I spoke

00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:28.420
there was a lady who spoke about Zionism. Zionism has very little to do with

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:29.450
Israel.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:32.150
Sounds surprising.

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:42.790
In case people you don't know, Zionism was the promise to bring the diaspora Jews to Palestine

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:46.640
and to establish a Jewish state.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:55.980
A Jewish state was established in 1948, and since then, Israelis are not concerned with

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:56.440
Zionism.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:59.420
I was born in Israel, we don't, we didn't know.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.980
We don't understand what Zionism is.

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:07.230
Zionism is very significant for the diaspora Jews,

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:10.940
because it allows them to identify with Israel

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:15.220
or to identify with its opposition.

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:18.820
But for Israelis, it doesn't mean a thing.

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:20.830
So they tell an Israeli,

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:22.590
I'm an anti-Zionist,

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:25.070
so this is, and what do you have for breakfast?

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:26.850
They don't understand what is the problem.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:37.060
Why do we use the word Zionism?

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:42.600
Because Israel, in fact, defines itself as the Jewish state.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:50.930
And it puts Star of David on its airplanes and tanks.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.460
So if we really want to understand what Israel is,

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:57.540
we have to ask what is the meaning of the Jewish state?

00:04:58.240 --> 00:04:59.760
What is the meaning of Jewishness?

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:04.990
But asking this question, something that I do all the time, really offends the Jews.

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:10.060
And the last thing that we want to do is to offend the Jews.

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:16.460
To offend the Jews, it's a suicidal attempt.

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:19.750
So we speak about Zionism.

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:27.500
We lie to ourselves, to the Palestinians, and to our listeners.

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:28.860
It's a myth.

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:38.740
Colonialism. We like to call Israel, Israel is a colonialism, Zionism is a colonialist movement.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.890
No, no, nonsense.

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:53.740
Colonialism, as you know very well, is a clear material exchange between a mother state and a settler state.

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.300
Am I right? Yes, I am right.

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:59.970
In Israel, it is a settler.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:11.790
But where is mommy? No mommy. Now we have kind of a bit for a while American mommy before we had French, British, you know?

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:16.060
In colonialism you cannot kind of change your mommy every three weeks.

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:22.060
It's not colonialism. It has nothing to do with colonialism.

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:29.970
It is a unique project of people who come back after 2,000 years and say, sorry, you have...

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:37.100
move. I've been here before. Quite unusual. I live in Britain. I still don't speak English,

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:44.760
but I managed to memorize a lot of texts. I live in Britain and I ask myself one day,

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:59.030
what would have happened if a bunch of Italian lunatics settle in Piccadilly circus and start to

00:06:59.030 --> 00:06:59.970
to dig and to

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:04.830
to build and, you know, and after a week, people are like, what are you doing?

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:08.930
You know, it's a traffic jam, this is the center, and they said, we are the Italians, the Romans,

00:07:09.230 --> 00:07:13.500
we come back. They wouldn't get away with it.

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:18.120
So why do we call Israel colonialism?

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:22.670
Because we don't want to offend the Jews.

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:26.150
It's very, no, we really don't want to offend the Jews.

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:29.970
If we call it, if you call it for what it is...

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:41.280
the Jews would be devastated. They much prefer to be like Britain, France, Portuguese, Spanish, Dutch.

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:55.550
But no, the Jewish settlement project is a unique project that is driven by racist inclinations,

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:59.870
nationalism, religious...

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:06.250
We can talk about religion. It's quite complicated to understand because it's an atheist movement.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:13.070
In fact, it is very similar to Nazi expansionism.

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:17.380
Now, if you say the truth, it's really going to offend the Jews.

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:22.780
Another nonsense, apartheid.

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:29.770
Apartheid is a very system...

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:43.680
of exploitation that is driven by clear racist intent or racist ideology.

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:46.620
But Israel is not apartheid.

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:49.730
They don't want to exploit the Palestinians.

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:51.150
They want them out.

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.040
Israel is an ethnic cleanser.

00:08:56.540 --> 00:08:58.120
Israel is an ethnic cleanser.

00:08:58.620 --> 00:08:59.180
Racist.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:04.960
ethnic cleanser driven by a nationalist ideology.

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:08.830
It is very similar to the Nazi ideology.

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:14.600
But we cannot say it because we would offend the Jews.

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:17.250
The Jews.

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:20.100
You also don't want to offend the Jews.

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:24.130
Listen, I was a Jew and I'm happy to be offended.

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:29.600
Now, it is very important sometimes...

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:43.680
To tell the truth, because if you want to improve the world we are living in, truth is of the essence.

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:48.640
And it is also very important to tell the truth to the Jews,

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.720
