is also misleading and I'm here for four talks and every day I will deconstruct

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:22.340
another discourse. I really looked into it and then I think that I know where

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:29.970
the problem is. In the right or with

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:39.800
the right political discourse. Traditionally, we have a clear dichotomy between scholarship

