and activism. What is activism? Activism is an attempt to make our world a better place,

00:11:55.470 --> 00:11:58.520
to introduce a social change. Beautiful thing.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:07.580
This scholarship is an attempt to reach at the bottom of things, the truth.

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:20.370
In the new left discourse, in the progressive discourse post-1968 revolution,

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:25.690
there is no dichotomy between the activists and the scholars.

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:29.970
If you look at your leading progressive activism...

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.040
like Chomsky or whatever they call themselves activists.

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:34.120
This is the problem.

00:12:35.970 --> 00:12:40.400
Once this dichotomy is blurred,

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:43.140
we start to compromise on the truth.

00:12:44.060 --> 00:12:46.320
Hey, but you know, we don't want to offend.

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:50.000
We all the time, we try to reach new allies.

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:54.050
I always, every day, I try to reach new enemies.

