Life under occupation, oppression.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:08.080
But in Detroit, there is no life.

00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:09.800
It is dead.

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:19.130
And it's about time to understand that we are all Palestinians.

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:24.340
Now, why we can't see it?

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:28.620
Because for some reason, and I'll talk about it in the next talks,

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:29.960
I don't want to...

