to drift too far from Palestine, we were trained to think EZE.

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:44.300
When I grew up in the 60s, 70s, 80s, the left told us that it doesn't matter if you're

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:47.960
a Jew or black or Muslim or a woman, a lesbian, gay.

