00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:25.080
Instead of looking into the most important thing, which is production, production.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.960
We fight for hours like sectarian words that are...

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.430
We have zero interest for the nation.

00:20:33.350 --> 00:20:35.150
Gay marriage, who cares about it?

00:20:35.270 --> 00:20:36.270
They want to get married.

00:20:36.850 --> 00:20:38.190
It's none of our business.

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:42.650
What we want is to work.

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:50.160
Palestine, the people in Ann Arbor in the night

