Why didn't you care for Detroit as much as you cared for Palestine?

00:21:12.930 --> 00:21:13.990
These are your neighbors.

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:21.800
This was a liquidation of class, of a productive class.

00:21:22.360 --> 00:21:23.840
Many blacks, Hispanics.

